--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b58ed87f6d683ae4380c703929b4aac3, type: 3}
  m_Name: OnGameResumed
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GameEvent
  enableDebugLogs: 0
  description: 'Raised when the game is resumed from pause state.


    Common Listeners:

    -
    UIManager: Hide pause menu, show gameplay UI

    - AudioManager: Transition
    back to normal audio snapshot

    - TimeManager: Set Time.timeScale = 1

    -
    PlayerController: Re-enable input

    - EnemyAI: Resume AI updates

    - ParticleManager:
    Resume all particle systems


    Use Case:

    Pair this with OnGamePaused
    for proper pause/resume flow.

    Raise when player presses "Resume" or ESC
    while paused.

    Should restore game to pre-pause state.'
